    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Partition accretionary structures at successive growth boundaries and test whether adding each increment produces a whole geometrically similar to the prior whole under one scale transformation. Deviations can be quantified by registered shape residuals.";
